@LiBot.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5205

### Move the LiBot robot
POST {{LiBot.Api_HostAddress}}/api/robots/libot/move
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "move_test_safe",
  "endpointId": "TEST_POINT_SAFE",
  "x": -0.8,
  "y": -0.7,
  "theta": 0.0,
  "speedMode": "NORMAL",
  "obstaclePolicy": "WAIT_RESUME",
  "timeoutSec": 60
}
